              <p className="mt-4 text-sm md:text-base text-white/70 font-body font-light max-w-lg">
                Join the first generation of deep-space travelers. Limited berths available for the 2026 Mars voyage.
              </p>
              <div className="flex items-center gap-4 mt-8">
                <button className="liquid-glass-strong rounded-full px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white font-body flex items-center gap-2">
